# issue: none
# notes: The compiler refuses a source declaring one name twice with `T83`, naming both declarations; nothing executes.

--- runner
timeout_ms: 10000
environments:
  - target: omnigraph-engine
    storage: local-filesystem

--- schema
node Person {
    handle: String @key
    name: String
}

--- seed
{"type":"Person","data":{"handle":"ada","name":"Ada"}}

--- query
query people() { match { $p: Person } return { $p.name } }
query people() { match { $p: Person } return { $p.handle } }

--- expect error: type error: T83: `people` is declared twice in one source, at line 1, column 7 and at line 2, column 7
